{"unit_id":"WJMACTD__dsh-deepseek-site#card-zh","repo":"WJMACTD/dsh-deepseek-site","commit":"14df4eb23c06e8e4b971a5164ffd327be7bc2629","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-site（DSH 插件，桌面面板）：在左侧栏加入 DeepSeek 官网入口，并在中央面板内嵌 chat.deepseek.com。它用独立 webview 保持页面跨面板切换存活，并在应用重启后回填本地保存的登录快照。主要功能有站内浏览、外链交给系统浏览器、登录状态记忆、忘记本机登录和加载失败时重试。适合希望在 Harness 窗口内使用 DeepSeek 聊天的用户；需要 DeepSeek 账号和支持 webview 的桌面容器。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:905-929","client.js:804-853","client.js:1275-1304"]}
{"unit_id":"WJMACTD__dsh-deepseek-site#card-en","repo":"WJMACTD/dsh-deepseek-site","commit":"14df4eb23c06e8e4b971a5164ffd327be7bc2629","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"This plugin embeds DeepSeek chat in a DSH desktop panel. Its webview survives panel switches and can restore a locally saved sign-in after restart. Users can open off-site links externally, clear the saved sign-in, or retry a failed load. Requires a DeepSeek account and the desktop browser bridge.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:905-929","client.js:804-853","client.js:1275-1304"]}
