{"unit_id":"WJMACTD__dsh-deepseek-site#feature-1","repo":"WJMACTD/dsh-deepseek-site","commit":"14df4eb23c06e8e4b971a5164ffd327be7bc2629","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-site 的功能「面板内嵌聊天」：客户端注册侧边栏入口和 main 面板，并以 webview 显示 DeepSeek 聊天页。点击入口后可在 Harness 中使用站点。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:905-929","client.js:1282-1297"]}
{"unit_id":"WJMACTD__dsh-deepseek-site#feature-2","repo":"WJMACTD/dsh-deepseek-site","commit":"14df4eb23c06e8e4b971a5164ffd327be7bc2629","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-site 的功能「跨面板保活」：网页容器挂在 document.body，切换面板时隐藏并在返回时重新定位，因此不会因 React 面板卸载而重载。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:574-585","client.js:1058-1073"]}
{"unit_id":"WJMACTD__dsh-deepseek-site#feature-3","repo":"WJMACTD/dsh-deepseek-site","commit":"14df4eb23c06e8e4b971a5164ffd327be7bc2629","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-site 的功能「登录快照回填」：插件只捕获站点的两个会话键并保存到应用 localStorage；下次加载时回放快照并重载网页。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:32-45","client.js:804-853"]}
{"unit_id":"WJMACTD__dsh-deepseek-site#feature-4","repo":"WJMACTD/dsh-deepseek-site","commit":"14df4eb23c06e8e4b971a5164ffd327be7bc2629","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-site 的功能「忘记本机登录」：工具栏操作删除应用侧快照，并尝试清除 guest 中对应键后重新加载，回到站点登录页。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1107-1129"]}
{"unit_id":"WJMACTD__dsh-deepseek-site#feature-5","repo":"WJMACTD/dsh-deepseek-site","commit":"14df4eb23c06e8e4b971a5164ffd327be7bc2629","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-site 的功能「外链与兜底」：站内导航留在 webview，站外 HTTPS 链接交给系统浏览器；缺少桌面浏览器桥时显示说明和外部打开选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:190-195","client.js:982-995","client.js:1159-1165"]}
